MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Corazon feels like a natural next choice because Santana's guitar-driven music connects with what I enjoy about Clapton and Hendrix.",
    "The later Beatles fit my classic rock interests, while Norah Jones offers a mellower option I could enjoy on another visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "A broad 80s compilation and traditional country do not fit the blues and roots rock I want right now, even though I sometimes enjoy other styles.",
    "Titles such as Greatest Hits and Definitive Collection give me no clear artist connection, so I cannot confidently connect them to my interests."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interaction with Blown Away seems to have been taken as a stronger reason to suggest more country than it is for this visit.",
    "The list seems to assume that familiar older music or hits collections will appeal to me simply because I listen to classic rock."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The connection between my Clapton and Hendrix listening and expressive, guitar-led blues and rock matters more to me right now than a shared era.",
    "I rarely choose many records at once; an album can fit my taste and still lose out to the one with the clearest connection to what I want today."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my classic rock interests but spread too broadly beyond the guitar-led blues and roots rock I want this visit."
}
